            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "So after thinking for a while, I came to conclusion that main problem here seems to be not \"separate mappings for Normal and Visual modes\", but \"How to configure similarly to 'tpope/vim-surround'\"? So I added the \"recommended\" way of doing so in documentation and tried to make it reasonably visible. It doesn't change current configuration options, but rather makes a remapping afterwards (few of them, actually).\r\n\r\nHope this answers your question. If not, feel free to elaborate here.",
