        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Great, always nice to be able to use existing functionality. Your suggestion works well, bonus points for the separate `(` and `)` bindings! I unmapped `ys` in visual mode, since with your suggestion `S` works.\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.keymap.del(\"v\", \"ys\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nThanks again!",
